{sec("white", f"""{split("", f"The Structure Behind<br>the Strategy{G}", "Wealth management begins with the investment mandate, not a standard product. The portfolio needs to reflect the client&rsquo;s objectives, risk parameters, liquidity requirements and constraints.")}<div class="big3 mt"><div class="it rv"><b>01</b><h3>Define the mandate</h3><p>Establish the investment objective, time horizon, liquidity needs and permitted instruments.</p></div><div class="it rv"><b>02</b><h3>Construct and manage</h3><p>Mandates informed by EMFI&rsquo;s own market intelligence, with execution, settlement and custody in the same group. {T("Compliance to approve: no performance or outcome claim is made")}</p></div><div class="it rv"><b>03</b><h3>Monitor and review</h3><p>Review the portfolio against its agreed parameters, risk framework and reporting requirements.</p></div></div><p class="fine" style="margin-top:22px">The nature of investment management services, decision-making responsibility and client eligibility depend on the relevant agreement, legal entity and regulatory permissions.</p>""")}
{sec("navy", f"""{split("", f"Portfolio Decisions.<br>Operational Visibility{G}", "Investment decisions do not end when an order is placed. Portfolio management also requires visibility over positions, cash, transactions and the activity that follows execution.")}<div class="mt">{dash_box()}</div>""")}
{sec("white", f"""<h2 style="margin-bottom:clamp(30px,4vw,56px)">The People Behind<br>the Portfolios{G}</h2>{team(["Usman Sheikh", "Alan Tooker", "Damian Juric"])}<p class="fine" style="margin-top:18px">{T("Confirm directors&rsquo; titles and approved biographies (A.R.C. Directors profiles supplied)")}</p>""")}
