page("responsive.html", "Trading Technology and Responsive Service | EMFI",
 "The EMFI Workstation, Dashboard and Mobile app, and the specialists who handle requirements that do not fit the standard process.", f'''
{tband("Responsive" + G, "Technology that works. People who respond.")}
{sec("pale", f"""{split("", f"Execution.<br>Connected{G}", "EMFI Workstation is the execution interface. It brings instrument search, market information, order entry and transaction monitoring into the same workflow.")}<div class="mt">{ws_box()}</div><div class="steps4 light"><div><b>VCON</b>Upload a Bloomberg confirmation</div><div><b>EXTRACT</b>Read trade details automatically</div><div><b>VALIDATE</b>Review extracted fields</div><div><b>PROCESS</b>Continue through trade controls</div></div><p class="fine" style="margin-top:14px">VCON upload is one trade-entry route alongside manual entry, spreadsheet upload, SFTP, API and supported drop-copy arrangements.</p>""")}
{sec("navy", f"""{split("", f"Everything<br>in View{G}", "The Dashboard gives clients and authorised users visibility over the operational picture: balances, positions, outstanding trades, activity and charges.")}<div class="mt">{dash_box()}</div>""")}
{sec("white", f"""{split("", f"Your Portfolio.<br>Within Reach{G}", "Mobile access puts relevant account and portfolio information within reach when users are away from their desks.")}<div class="mt rv">{phones()}</div><p class="lead" style="margin-top:30px;max-width:none"><strong>One connected operating picture.</strong> Workstation, Dashboard and Mobile serve different parts of the client and operating experience.</p><p class="fine" style="margin-top:12px">Illustrative interface. Not live client data. {T("Use authentic, current app screens and verified App Store / Google Play destinations; mask or label any demonstration data")}</p>""")}
{sec("pale", f"""{split("", f"Not Everything<br>Fits a Dropdown{G}", "Markets are not always standard. Client requirements are not always standard either.")}<p class="lead rv" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:none">A particular security, a cross-depository settlement route, a specific account structure or a time-sensitive instruction can require more than a standard workflow. EMFI starts by understanding the requirement, then assesses the available infrastructure, permissions, counterparties and operational constraints. Where a workable route exists, our people coordinate the details with you and the relevant providers.</p><p class="rv" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4.4vw,64px);font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.08;margin:clamp(36px,6vw,80px) 0 0;max-width:24ch">Technology handles repeatable steps. <strong style="font-weight:800" class="grad">Experienced people deal with exceptions, judgement and follow-through.</strong></p><p class="fine" style="margin-top:32px">Every solution remains subject to applicable regulatory permissions, client eligibility, due diligence, sanctions screening, risk controls, market rules and third-party capabilities. EMFI does not undertake activity where those requirements cannot be met.</p>""")}''', None)

